{
  "abstract": "Eventual equality on the actual Cantor product has a BP invariant-set zero-one law. Every invariant map with BP open preimages into a second countable T0 target has a comeagre constant fiber. Consequently no such BP map, and no Borel map with explicit Borel sigma-algebras, reduces eventual equality to equality.",
